/// Send an email via Resend with analytics tags (e.g.
/// `[#("template", "application_invite"), #("vacancy_id", …)]`). Tags ride
/// Resend's `tags` array and become filterable dimensions in the Resend
/// dashboard — they are what makes open/click rates sliceable per template
/// and per vacancy once domain-level open/click tracking is enabled (a
/// dashboard/DNS change, not code). An empty list omits the field entirely.
